00:15:43,140 --> 00:15:45,140
God was teaching me something.

00:15:45,140 --> 00:15:49,140
I talked to my wife about this.

00:15:49,140 --> 00:15:51,140
It was great having that time off,

00:15:51,140 --> 00:15:53,140
and it was wonderful,

00:15:53,140 --> 00:15:55,140
spending time with the love of my life.

00:15:55,140 --> 00:15:58,140
But God just revealed to me,

00:15:58,140 --> 00:16:00,140
I need to get back to work.

00:16:00,140 --> 00:16:02,140
I just cannot take time off of work.

00:16:02,140 --> 00:16:04,140
There's other role of going on vacation

00:16:04,140 --> 00:16:06,140
and sharpening your saw.

00:16:06,140 --> 00:16:08,140
I took a week off after Christmas.

00:16:08,140 --> 00:16:10,140
And it was wonderful.

00:16:10,140 --> 00:16:12,140
And we all need to do that.

00:16:12,140 --> 00:16:14,140
But my main purpose has to get back

00:16:14,140 --> 00:16:16,140
to what God has me for.

00:16:16,140 --> 00:16:18,140
That is to be a doctor to my patients

00:16:18,140 --> 00:16:20,140
and to be constantly digging and searching

00:16:20,140 --> 00:16:23,140
and writing and helping and serving.

00:16:23,140 --> 00:16:26,140
Because that's just the purpose that God has for me.

00:16:26,140 --> 00:16:28,140
And my comment to my patients

00:16:28,140 --> 00:16:31,140
would be, look and see what God's purpose is for you.

00:16:31,140 --> 00:16:34,140
Because yes, you should do what you need to do

00:16:34,140 --> 00:16:38,140
to overcome the burden of what you have going on,

00:16:38,140 --> 00:16:40,140
the cancer, the sickness, the life,

00:16:40,140 --> 00:16:42,140
the whatever you're dealing with right now.

00:16:42,140 --> 00:16:44,140
But if that is your purpose in life,

00:16:44,140 --> 00:16:46,140
you miss the boat.

00:16:46,140 --> 00:16:48,140
You're off the mark.

00:16:48,140 --> 00:16:52,140
You are running the wrong race.

00:16:52,140 --> 00:16:56,140
And we do not want to be guilty of missing the mark.

00:16:56,140 --> 00:17:00,140
The mark is not to be cured of your cancer.

00:17:00,140 --> 00:17:03,140
If that is your purpose in your life to be cured of cancer,

00:17:03,140 --> 00:17:06,140
you are running the wrong race, bro.

00:17:06,140 --> 00:17:09,140
You are totally off-game.

00:17:09,140 --> 00:17:12,140
Your purpose in life is to serve God

00:17:12,140 --> 00:17:18,140
and to break him glory in whatever channel he has you in.

00:17:18,140 --> 00:17:23,140
And if it is through you getting over your cancer,

00:17:23,140 --> 00:17:24,140
well, that's great.

00:17:24,140 --> 00:17:28,140
If it is through you dying of cancer, well, I'm sorry.

00:17:28,140 --> 00:17:30,140
But that's great too.

00:17:30,140 --> 00:17:34,140
And I will need to die for cancer while I walk in my victory,

00:17:34,140 --> 00:17:39,140
which is serving him and bringing him glory if that's what he chooses.

00:17:39,140 --> 00:17:43,140
And if he chooses me to live longer, then that's great too.

00:17:43,140 --> 00:17:46,140
I'll just continue to serve him.

00:17:46,140 --> 00:17:49,140
That's the piece that I got out of this book.

00:17:49,140 --> 00:17:54,140
And it just drove me back to work again just to keep my focus there.

00:17:54,140 --> 00:17:59,140
Not on working to cure my cancer, but working to help my patients

00:17:59,140 --> 00:18:05,140
and help others and bring the truth of him and to bring him glory through serving him.

00:18:05,140 --> 00:18:08,140
And that's what I want for you to.

00:18:08,140 --> 00:18:13,140
So that's my prayer for you guys today that you come to your victory

00:18:13,140 --> 00:18:19,140
by hanging on to the victor and him revealing to you

00:18:19,140 --> 00:18:22,140
what your ultimate purpose is is to serve him.

00:18:22,140 --> 00:18:26,140
Not to cure cancer, not to solve your financial problems,

00:18:26,140 --> 00:18:32,140
not to overcome your struggles, not to cure your whatever.

00:18:32,140 --> 00:18:37,140
Problems in your life are there for a purpose to reveal to you

00:18:37,140 --> 00:18:42,510
that you need to hold on more dearly to him.

00:18:42,510 --> 00:18:44,510
And that's my prayer for you.

00:18:44,510 --> 00:18:46,510
Thanks for listening.

00:18:46,510 --> 00:18:47,510
Love you all.

00:18:47,510 --> 00:18:48,510
Bye-bye.

